{
  "id": 8835550806215,
  "title": "Custom Patriotic Semi Truck on American Flag Background Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-patriotic-semi-truck-on-american-flag-background-comforter-e664ba94f8-e664ba94f8",
  "body_html": "<p>This custom trucker comforter is designed especially for road legends who love the journey. Featuring a striking design, this soft and cozy comforter set makes a thoughtful personalized gift for family, friends, or any trucking enthusiast. Sleep in comfort and style while showcasing your passion for the open road.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Touch:</strong> Customize your bedding set with a personalized name input for a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from US Twin (68' x 88'), US Full (78' x 88'), US Queen (88' x 88'), or US King (104' x 88') options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Features 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) with optional matching pillowcases based on your selection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, air dry without heat, and quick-drying for effortless maintenance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Amazing Flag Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>American Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
